<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-008-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.411253" lon="-120.895528"><name>SC26-008-A</name><cmt>SC26-008</cmt><desc>Morro inshore mound Distinct shallow mound with nearly continuous rough-rock classification. Terrain A 86/100; not catch probability. Center 49 ft; nearby 43–80 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional point-specific flag from this screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-060</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.41358270879711" lon="-120.89728468291968"/><trkpt lat="35.41195885919195" lon="-120.89721676678329"/><trkpt lat="35.41177481006196" lon="-120.89700131576078"/><trkpt lat="35.4109638437515" lon="-120.89702239331343"/><trkpt lat="35.409784778343315" lon="-120.89661257897642"/><trkpt lat="35.40978094303483" lon="-120.89639244993653"/><trkpt lat="35.409508703175625" lon="-120.8962894132598"/><trkpt lat="35.409493357284184" lon="-120.89540890053549"/><trkpt lat="35.409757922766595" lon="-120.89507167657052"/><trkpt lat="35.40974640722138" lon="-120.89441129044924"/><trkpt lat="35.41019118418891" lon="-120.89406937204062"/><trkpt lat="35.410363718201026" lon="-120.89362442126557"/><trkpt lat="35.410994468470136" lon="-120.8936080015731"/><trkpt lat="35.41098870697344" lon="-120.893277803733"/><trkpt la